I would suggest something like {.i jetnu fa PA me lo du'u ... jo'u lo du'u
...}. Note that this is a xorlo-specific solution, since it uses xorlo's
definition of {me}. It's a little verbose, but not that bad, and it is also
pretty flexible. For example, "exactly one of "A","B and C","D" is true" is
easy to build this way, by putting "B and C" in the second du'u.

mi'e la latro'a mu'o

